<% content_for :title, 'My Traveller Universe' %>
<% content_for :page_kicker, 'Operational Summary' %>
<% content_for :page_title, 'My Traveller Universe' %>

<%= render 'application/page' do %>
  <div class='space-y-4 max-w-4xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed'>
    <p>
      My Traveller Universe is a campaign management and system generation tool for Traveller Referees.
      It is designed for exploration campaigns such as
      <%= link_to 'Deepnight Revelation',
                  'https://www.mongoosepublishing.com/products/deepnight-revelation-core-set',
                  target: '_blank',
                  rel: 'noopener noreferrer',
                  class: 't-link' %>,
      and for Referees charting an entirely original galaxy.
    </p>

    <p>
      At its centre is a comprehensive star system generator built on the rules from the
      <%= link_to 'World Builder\'s Handbook',
                  'https://www.mongoosepublishing.com/products/world-builders-handbook',
                  target: '_blank',
                  rel: 'noopener noreferrer',
                  class: 't-link' %>.
      Referees may construct their setting one system at a time,
      shaping each world individually,
      or define subsector-level build specifications to generate coherent subsectors or entire sectors in a single operation.
    </p>

    <p>
      For Deepnight campaigns, subsector build specifications can be imported from
      <%= link_to 'travellermap.com',
                  'https://travellermap.com',
                  target: '_blank',
                  rel: 'noopener noreferrer',
                  class: 't-link' %>
      or from predefined systems based on the campaign books.
      Generated systems can then be supplemented with referee-authored detail and campaign-specific content,
      forming a structured survey record of the space your Travellers encounter.
    </p>

    <p>
      In addition to the World Builder's Referees will also find the
      <%= link_to 'Traveller Core Rulebook',
                  'https://www.mongoosepublishing.com/products/traveller-core-rulebook-update-2022',
                  target: '_blank',
                  rel: 'noopener noreferrer',
                  class: 't-link' %>
      a handy reference.
    </p>

    <% unless authenticated? %>
      <div class='flex items-center gap-4 pt-2'>
        <%= link_to 'Sign up', new_registration_path, class: 'btn btn-primary' %>
      </div>
    <% end %>

    <p class='text-sm text-slate-500'>
      My Traveller Universe operates under Mongoose Publishing's
      <%= link_to 'Fair Use Policy', fairuse_path, class: 't-link' %>.
    </p>
  </div>
<% end %>